    <item>
      <title>360° Panoramic Bubble Hotel Star Room | Transparent Dome Glamping Pod Manufacturer in China</title>
      <link>https://mobilehouse.asia/other/360-panoramic-bubble-hotel-star-room/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Jun 2025 09:42:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://mobilehouse.asia/other/360-panoramic-bubble-hotel-star-room/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;360-panoramic-bubble-hotel-star-room--transparent-dome-for-glamping--resorts-xc-capsule-dome-for-outdoor-dining-venues&#34;&gt;360° Panoramic Bubble Hotel Star Room – Transparent Dome for Glamping &amp;amp; Resorts-XC Capsule Dome for Outdoor Dining Venues&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ideal for restaurants, farmhouse inns, hotpot &amp;amp; BBQ joints, cafes, bars, and teahouses&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;XC’s Star Capsule Dome series is designed for commercial outdoor spaces such as dining, leisure, and hospitality venues. With over 10 years of experience in polycarbonate (PC) processing, we are one of China’s earliest manufacturers specializing in geodesic capsule structures. We are now actively seeking regional distributors and welcome cooperation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
