      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;-product-overview&#34;&gt;🌟 Product Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Office Apple Pod&lt;/strong&gt; is a mobile, prefabricated unit with minimalist styling and high functionality. Designed for fast deployment and long-lasting performance, it’s suitable for use as:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Remote office or studio&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Tiny home / Airbnb cabin&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;B&amp;amp;B unit or outdoor guest room&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Commercial space or sales booth&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Constructed with a &lt;strong&gt;hot-dip galvanized steel frame&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SPC waterproof flooring&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;carbon fiber composite walls&lt;/strong&gt;, this pod delivers comfort, strength, and thermal performance in any climate.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
